# Learner-generated artifacts from running this lab in place — never committed.
# The lab's canonical HCL is main.tf + backend.tf (tracked, drift-checked);
# backend-s3.tf.off is the tracked-but-inert Stretch variant. Everything below
# is generated at apply time, by the backend migration in this lab, or by the
# Stretch's backend swap. The state file MUST NEVER be committed: it holds the
# generated secret in plaintext.
